Do: Keep a shared journal, updating it every few days with
thoughts and experiences.
Avoid: Becoming complacent in communication.
Avoid: Ignoring signs of emotional exhaustion in your
partner.
Avoid: Over-committing to social responsibilities and
neglecting 'us' time.
Do: Make room for private time to reconnect emotionally.
Do: Re-establish routines slowly to provide a sense of
